NAME: Altitude

DESCRIPTION:

Displays and graphs altitude.

Altitude values are in feet above Mean Sea Level.

NOTES:

Permission to access fine location must be granted.

The Altitude app relies on altitude data that is 
saved in svcs/Altitude/altitude.dat, by the Altitude
service. The altitude.dat stores hourly altitude data,
and supports storing altitude data from year 2026 to 2045.

The Altitude service obtains altitude data from GPS.
GPS altitude raw readings are based on the WGS84 
ellipsoid, not mean sea level. EzApp uses the 
Android AltitudeConverter to convert the WGS84 values to 
mean sea level.

Even when using the AltitudeConverter, to convert the
raw GPS to MSL, the altitude can be off by 150 feet.
